# Shell scripts and Node scripts MUST keep LF endings. A .sh file checked out
# with CRLF fails on Linux with "\r: command not found" — and these run on the
# CI runner and the VPS, so a Windows checkout committing CRLF would break
# deploys in a way that is genuinely hard to read from the error message.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
